<title>MOROCCO: Moroccan C.Bank injects 1.6 bln dirhams at auction.</title>
<headline>Moroccan C.Bank injects 1.6 bln dirhams at auction.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morocco's Bank al-Maghrib (central bank) injected 1.635 billion dirhams via a one-week repurchase rate operation, a bank official said said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The bank received bids totalling 5.494 billion dirhams and allocated 2.500 billion dirhams at 6.5 percent. It was more than the 865 million dirhams leaving the market this week.</p>
<p>The next auction will be on August 13.</p>
<p>($1= 10 dirhams)</p>
</text>
